      "name": "Cone of Chalk",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The living graffiti expels a 15ft Cone of chalk. Each creature in the area must succeed at a DC 20 Reflex Saving Throw save or be Blinded for 1 round or until it Interacts to wipe the chalk from its eyes.</p>\n<p>The living graffiti can't use Cone of Chalk again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
